        <body>
            <div xml:id="d713-a1">

                <pb facs="1299" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1175"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. E. Assim Pacha</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister for Foreign Affairs, of H. M. the
                    Sultan</hi>.</p>
                <p>Monsieur le <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministre</hi>: The court-martial
                    appointed to try Veli Mehemet, the murderer of Lieutenant-Colonel Kummeran,
                    pronounced in May last a sentence of death.</p>
                <p>Several months have elapsed since this sentence, and the undersigned have noticed
                    with surprise that nothing has been done yet for its execution.</p>
                <p>Painfully impressed by such an inexplicable delay and justly moved by the
                    consequences that the impunity of the crime may have on the security of
                    foreigners in Turkey, the undersigned are under the necessity of requesting His
                    Excellency Assim Pacha, minister of foreign affairs, of His Majesty the Sultan,
                    to have the kindness to let them know when finally satisfaction will be given to
                    public opinion by the execution of the sentence given against the criminal.</p>
                <p>The undersigned take this occasion to renew to his excellency the minister of
                    foreign affairs the assurances of their high consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>MOHSIN (Persia).</item>
                            <item>HATZFELDT (Germany).</item>
                            <item>NOVIKOW (Russia).</item>
                            <item>G. J. GOSCHEN (Great Britain).</item>
                            <item>L. CORTI (Italy).</item>
                            <item>TH. TISSOT (France).</item>
                            <item>CALICE (Austria).</item>
                            <item>A. G. COUNDOURIOTTIS (Greece).</item>
                            <item>T. <hi rendition="#small-caps">d</hi>’EHRENHOFF (Sweden).</item>
                            <item>GRONITCH (Servia).</item>
                            <item>VAN ITTERSUM (Holland).</item>
                            <item>BARTHOLEYUS <hi rendition="#small-caps">de</hi> FOSSELÆRT
                                (Belgium).</item>
                            <item>G. H. HEAP (United States).</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
